] and be good. I was in San Francisco for a wedding and decided to take a detour to Muir Woods. It was a gorgeous day and the redwoods were stunning. I had my Nikon D800 with Nikkor 24-70mm f/2.8 lens and was shooting in RAW+JPEG. I did not have a tripod so I used a monopod to steady the camera.
